<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech ZDAS H1 gross profit falls sharply.</title>
<headline>Czech ZDAS H1 gross profit falls sharply.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six-month period</p>
<p>ending June 30, 1996: (in million crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit		 27.1    vs     80.1</p>
<p> Operating profit	    0.97   vs    121.3</p>
<p>Revenues from sales of</p>
<p>  goods and services     908.0    vs    948.5</p>
<p> Assets		    3,261.8    vs  3,310.6</p>
<p> Basic capital	   1,395.3    vs  1,395.3</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is ZDAS a.s., a heavy engineering and machinery maker.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
